"synchronization:synchronize teams and channels>` documentation for "
"further details."
msgstr "활성화하면, 그룹에서 사용자를 추가하고 제거하면 이 팀에서도 추가되거나 제거됩니다. 이 팀에 구성원을 초대하는 유일한 방법은 사용자가 속한 그룹을 추가하는 것입니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`팀 및 채널 동기화 <administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-synchronization:synchronize teams and channels>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:426
msgid ""
"In the **Team Management** section, enable the **Sync Group Members** "
"option."
msgstr "**Team Management** 섹션에서, **Sync Group Members** 옵션을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:429
msgid "Enable Sync Group Members for a team using the System Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 팀에 대해 Sync Group Members를 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:433
msgid "Anyone can join this team"
msgstr "누구나 이 팀에 참여 가능"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:435
msgid ""
"This team can be discovered allowing anyone with an account to join this "
"team."
msgstr "이 팀을 검색할 수 있게 되어 계정이 있는 누구나 이 팀에 참여할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:439
msgid ""
"In the **Team Management** section, enable the **Anyone can join this "
"team** option."
msgstr "**Team Management** 섹션에서, **Anyone can join this team** 옵션을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:442
msgid ""
"Enable Anyone can join this team option for a team using the System "
"Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 팀에 대해 Anyone can join this team 옵션을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:446
msgid "Only specific email domains can join this team"
msgstr "특정 이메일 도메인만 이 팀에 참여 가능"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:448
msgid ""
"Users can only join the team if their email matches one of the specified "
"domains."
msgstr "사용자는 이메일이 지정된 도메인 중 하나와 일치하는 경우에만 팀에 참여할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:452
msgid ""
"In the **Team Management** section, enable the **Only specific email "
"domains can join this team** option and add the specific domains."
msgstr "**Team Management** 섹션에서, **Only specific email domains can join this team** 옵션을 활성화하고 특정 도메인을 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:455
msgid ""
"Enable Only specific email domains can join this team option for a team "
"using the System Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 팀에 대해 Only specific email domains can join this team 옵션을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:459
msgid "Synchronize team members"
msgstr "팀 구성원 동기화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:461
msgid ""
"Admins can choose between inviting members to a team manually or "
"synchronizing members automatically from AD/LDAP groups. See the "
":ref:`using AD/LDAP synchronized groups  <administration-guide/onboard"
"/ad-ldap-groups-synchronization:synchronize ad/ldap groups to "
"mattermost>` documentation for details on managing team or private "
"channel membership."
msgstr "관리자는 팀에 구성원을 수동으로 초대하거나 AD/LDAP 그룹에서 구성원을 자동으로 동기화하는 것 중에서 선택할 수 있습니다. 팀 또는 비공개 채널 멤버십 관리에 대한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`AD/LDAP 동기화 그룹 사용 <administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-synchronization:synchronize ad/ldap groups to mattermost>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:464
msgid "Archive the team"
msgstr "팀 보관"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:468
msgid "In the **Team Profile** section, select **Archive Team**."
msgstr "**Team Profile** 섹션에서, **Archive Team**을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:471
msgid "Archive a team using the System Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 팀을 보관합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:477
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "채널"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:480
msgid "Find Channels"
msgstr "채널 찾기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:482
msgid ""
"Find existing channels in your Mattermost instance using the System "
"Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 OKR.BEST 인스턴스의 기존 채널을 찾습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:484
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:495
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:508
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:524
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:537
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:550
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:563
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:580
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:602
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:615
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:634
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:647
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:658
msgid ""
"Go to **System Console > User Management > Channels** to access all "
"available channels."
msgstr "사용 가능한 모든 채널에 접근하려면 **관리자 도구 > User Management > Channels**로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:485
msgid "Enter the channel name in the **Search** box."
msgstr "**Search** 상자에 채널 이름을 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:487
msgid "Find a Mattermost channel using the System Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 OKR.BEST 채널을 찾습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:491
msgid "Filter channel searches"
msgstr "채널 검색 필터링"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:493
msgid ""
"Filter your channel search to narrow down results based on the channel "
"type (as public, private or archived), channel management type (group "
"sync or manual invites) or based on the team the channel belongs to."
msgstr "채널 유형(공개, 비공개 또는 보관됨), 채널 관리 유형(그룹 동기화 또는 수동 초대) 또는 채널이 속한 팀을 기준으로 결과를 좁히기 위해 채널 검색을 필터링합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:497
msgid "Choose any filter and select **Apply** to filter channel search results."
msgstr "필터를 선택하고 **Apply**를 선택하여 채널 검색 결과를 필터링합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:499
msgid ""
"Filter the channels based on channel type, channel membership types or "
"they team that they belong to using the System Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널 유형, 채널 멤버십 유형 또는 채널이 속한 팀을 기준으로 채널을 필터링합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:504
msgid "Review channel configuration"
msgstr "채널 구성 검토"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:506
msgid ""
"View channel configuration details using the System Console. Gather "
"information including the channel profile, advanced access controls, "
"channel management options, groups, and members."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널 구성 세부 정보를 봅니다. 채널 프로필, 고급 액세스 제어, 채널 관리 옵션, 그룹 및 구성원을 포함한 정보를 수집합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:509
msgid ""
"Select a channel from the list to review its channel configuration "
"details."
msgstr "목록에서 채널을 선택하여 해당 채널 구성 세부 정보를 검토합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:511
msgid "Review channel configuration details using the System Console"
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널 구성 세부 정보를 검토합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:515
msgid "Advanced Access Control"
msgstr "고급 액세스 제어"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:517
msgid "Manage the Management actions available to channel members and guests."
msgstr "채널 구성원 및 게스트가 사용할 수 있는 관리 작업을 관리합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:520
msgid "Create Posts"
msgstr "게시물 작성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:522
msgid "The ability for members and guests to create posts in the channel."
msgstr "구성원과 게스트가 채널에서 게시물을 작성할 수 있는 권한입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:525
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:538
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:551
msgid "Select a channel from the list to view its configuration page."
msgstr "목록에서 채널을 선택하여 해당 구성 페이지를 봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:526
msgid ""
"In the **Create Posts** section under the **Advanced Access Control** "
"tab, select the option for **Guests**, **Members**, or both to enable "
"those users to post messages in the channel."
msgstr "**Advanced Access Control** 탭 아래의 **Create Posts** 섹션에서, **Guests**, **Members** 또는 둘 다에 대한 옵션을 선택하여 해당 사용자가 채널에 메시지를 게시할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:529
msgid "Add Members and Guests to post to the channel using the System Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널에 게시할 수 있도록 구성원과 게스트를 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:533
msgid "Post Reactions"
msgstr "게시물 반응"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:535
msgid ""
"The ability for members and guests to react with emojis on messages in "
"the channel."
msgstr "구성원과 게스트가 채널의 메시지에 이모지로 반응할 수 있는 권한입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:539
msgid ""
"In the **Post Reactions** section under the **Advanced Access Control** "
"tab, select the option for **Guests**, **Members**, or both to enable "
"those users to react with emojis on messages posted to the channel."
msgstr "**Advanced Access Control** 탭 아래의 **Post Reactions** 섹션에서, **Guests**, **Members** 또는 둘 다에 대한 옵션을 선택하여 해당 사용자가 채널에 게시된 메시지에 이모지로 반응할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:542
msgid ""
"Add Members and Guests to post reactions to the channel using the System "
"Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널에 반응을 게시할 수 있도록 구성원과 게스트를 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:546
msgid "Manage Members"
msgstr "구성원 관리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:548
msgid ""
"The ability for members to add and remove people from the channels. "
"Guests can't add or remove people from channels."
msgstr "구성원이 채널에서 사람을 추가하고 제거할 수 있는 권한입니다. 게스트는 채널에서 사람을 추가하거나 제거할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:552
msgid ""
"In the **Manage Members** section under the **Advanced Access Control** "
"tab, select **Members** to enable those users to manage members for the "
"channel."
msgstr "**Advanced Access Control** 탭 아래의 **Manage Members** 섹션에서, **Members**를 선택하여 해당 사용자가 채널의 구성원을 관리할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:555
msgid ""
"Allow Members to add or remove people from the channel using the System "
"Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 구성원이 채널에서 사람을 추가하거나 제거할 수 있도록 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:559
msgid "Channel Mentions"
msgstr "채널 멘션"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:561
msgid ""
"The ability for members and guests to use channel mentions, including "
"**@all**, **@here**, and **@channel**, in the channel."
msgstr "구성원과 게스트가 채널에서 **@all**, **@here**, **@channel**을 포함한 채널 멘션을 사용할 수 있는 권한입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:564
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:581
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:603
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:616
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:635
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:648
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:659
msgid "Select the channel from the list to view its configuration page."
msgstr "목록에서 채널을 선택하여 해당 구성 페이지를 봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:565
msgid ""
"In the **Channel Mentions** section under the **Advanced Access Control**"
" tab, select the option for **Guests**, **Members**, or both to enable "
"those users to use channel mentions."
msgstr "**Advanced Access Control** 탭 아래의 **Channel Mentions** 섹션에서, **Guests**, **Members** 또는 둘 다에 대한 옵션을 선택하여 해당 사용자가 채널 멘션을 사용할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:568
msgid ""
"Add Members and Guests to use mentions in a channel using the System "
"Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널에서 멘션을 사용할 수 있도록 구성원과 게스트를 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:573
msgid ""
"**Guests** and **Members** can't use channel mentions without the ability"
" to **Create Posts**. To enable this permission, these users must have "
"been granted **Create Posts** permission first."
msgstr "**Guests** 및 **Members**는 **Create Posts** 권한 없이는 채널 멘션을 사용할 수 없습니다. 이 권한을 활성화하려면, 이러한 사용자에게 먼저 **Create Posts** 권한이 부여되어 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:576
msgid "Manage Bookmarks"
msgstr "북마크 관리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:578
msgid ""
"The ability for members to add, delete, and sort bookmarks. Guests can't "
"add, remove, or sort bookmarks for the channel."
msgstr "구성원이 북마크를 추가, 삭제, 정렬할 수 있는 권한입니다. 게스트는 채널의 북마크를 추가, 제거 또는 정렬할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:582
msgid ""
"In the **Manage Bookmarks** section under the **Advanced Access Control**"
" tab, select **Members** to enable those users to add, sort, or remove "
"bookmarks for the channel."
msgstr "**Advanced Access Control** 탭 아래의 **Manage Bookmarks** 섹션에서, **Members**를 선택하여 해당 사용자가 채널의 북마크를 추가, 정렬 또는 제거할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:585
msgid ""
"Allow Members to manage bookmarks for the channel using the System "
"Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 구성원이 채널의 북마크를 관리할 수 있도록 허용합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:590
msgid ""
"The ability to manage bookmarks for the channel is available for "
"**Members** only. **Guests** can't add, remove or sort bookmarks for the "
"channel."
msgstr "채널의 북마크를 관리하는 권한은 **Members**에게만 제공됩니다. **Guests**는 채널의 북마크를 추가, 제거 또는 정렬할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:593
msgid "Channel Management"
msgstr "채널 관리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:595
msgid ""
"Choose between inviting members manually or sychronizing members "
"automatically from groups."
msgstr "구성원을 수동으로 초대하거나 그룹에서 구성원을 자동으로 동기화하는 것 중에서 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:598
msgid "Sync Group Members"
msgstr "그룹 구성원 동기화"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:604
msgid ""
"In the **Channel Management** tab, enable the **Sync Group Members** "
"option."
msgstr "**Channel Management** 탭에서, **Sync Group Members** 옵션을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:607
msgid "Enable Sync Group Members for a channel using the System Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널에 대해 Sync Group Members를 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:611
msgid "Public channel or private channel"
msgstr "공개 채널 또는 비공개 채널"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:613
msgid ""
"Public channels are discoverable and any user can join. Private channels "
"require invitations to join."
msgstr "공개 채널은 검색 가능하며 모든 사용자가 참여할 수 있습니다. 비공개 채널은 참여하려면 초대가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:617
msgid ""
"In the **Public channel or private channel** section under the **Channel "
"Management** tab, toggle between **Public** or **Private** to change "
"channel visibility."
msgstr "**Channel Management** 탭 아래의 **Public channel or private channel** 섹션에서, **Public** 또는 **Private** 사이를 토글하여 채널 표시 여부를 변경합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:620
msgid ""
"Set the channel visibility to either Public or Private using the System "
"Console."
msgstr "관리자 도구를 사용하여 채널 표시 여부를 공개 또는 비공개로 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:624
msgid ""
"When Group Sync is enabled, private channels can't be converted to public"
" channels."
msgstr "그룹 동기화가 활성화되면, 비공개 채널을 공개 채널로 변환할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:627
msgid "Members"
msgstr "구성원"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:629
msgid ""
"Choose between inviting members manually or synchronizing members "
"automatically from groups."
msgstr "구성원을 수동으로 초대하거나 그룹에서 구성원을 자동으로 동기화하는 것 중에서 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/user-management-configuration-settings.rst:637
msgid ""
"Use the **Search** box to find a specific user or group to add to the "
"channel."
